ng to change anything.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/961450/extras/ada86937cd97a48ecd77df352a658633.avif?t=1689967121\" /></div>",
